.TH geectl-remote-create-project 1  "geectl-remote-create-project 0.2.4" 
.SH NAME
geectl\-remote\-create\-project \- Create a project. A mutation: dry\-run is the default (only the plan is printed); `\-\-live` performs the creation
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBgeectl remote create\-project\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fB\-\-title\fR> <\fB\-\-description\fR> <\fIPROJECT\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Create a project. A mutation: dry\-run is the default (only the plan is printed); `\-\-live` performs the creation
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-title\fR \fI<TITLE>\fR
The project title
.TP
\fB\-\-description\fR \fI<DESCRIPTION>\fR
The project description
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fIPROJECT\fR>
The project to create
.SH VERSION
v0.2.4
